info: Mandatory: [severity level] of [event] is {{tagSeverity}}

tokens option:
INTERFACE_DEF, CLASS_DEF, ENUM_DEF, ANNOTATION_DEF, RECORD_DEF: Mandatory: [tokens] to check is {{tokens}}

Options that are data specifications:
{{tag}}: String; {any valid tag name}; {null}
{{tagFormat}}: Pattern; {any valid regular expression}; {null}
{{tagSeverity}}: SeverityLevel; {info, warning, error}; {info}
{{tokens}}: String[]; {INTERFACE_DEF, CLASS_DEF, ENUM_DEF, ANNOTATION_DEF, METHOD_DEF, CTOR_DEF, ENUM_CONSTANT_DEF, ANNOTATION_FIELD_DEF, RECORD_DEF, COMPACT_CTOR_DEF}; {INTERFACE_DEF, CLASS_DEF, ENUM_DEF, ANNOTATION_DEF, RECORD_DEF}

CyclomaticComplexity:
Final RuleSet Representation:

Basic Rule:
Mandatory: Number of [decision points] of [method, constructor, static initializer, instance initializer] + 1 <= {{max}}

Option Rule:
switchBlockAsSingleDecisionPoint option:
true: Mandatory: Number of [switch block] of [decision points] is 1
false: Optional: Number of [switch block] of [decision points] is not 1

Options that are data specifications:
{{max}}: int; {0, 1, 2, ..., 2147483647}; {10}
{{tokens}}: String[]; {LITERAL_WHILE, LITERAL_DO, LITERAL_FOR, LITERAL_IF, LITERAL_SWITCH, LITERAL_CASE, LITERAL_CATCH, QUESTION, LAND, LOR}; {LITERAL_WHILE, LITERAL_DO, LITERAL_FOR, LITERAL_IF, LITERAL_SWITCH, LITERAL_CASE, LITERAL_CATCH, QUESTION, LAND, LOR}

MethodName:
Final RuleSet Representation:

Basic Rule:
Mandatory: [method name] matches {{format}}
And
Optional: [method name] is not [class name] -> [method name] is not [constructor]

Option Rule:
allowClassName option:
false: Mandatory: [method name] is not [class name]
true: Optional: [method name] is [class name]

applyToPackage option:
true: Mandatory: [method name] of [package-private member] matches {{format}}
false: Optional: [method name] of [package-private member] not matches {{format}}

applyToPrivate option:
true: Mandatory: [method name] of [private member] matches {{format}}
false: Optional: [method name] of [private member] not matches {{format}}

applyToProtected option:
true: Mandatory: [method name] of [protected member] matches {{format}}
false: Optional: [method name] of [protected member] not matches {{format}}

applyToPublic option:
true: Mandatory: [method name] of [public member] matches {{format}}
false: Optional: [method name] of [public member] not matches {{format}}

Options that are data specifications:
{{format}}: Pattern; "^[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*$"; "^[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*$"
